/*
Expression values:
SERVER				Server per-level script VM
CLIENT				Client per-level script VM
UI					UI script VM
SP					Singleplayer
MP					Multiplayer
DEV					S3 RSON When token only. Native evaluator reads developer cvar (>0).
					When: must use DEV; DEVELOPER is unknown on S3 and parse-fatal.
DEVELOPER			Squirrel #if token only (SDK RegisterConstant + compile prelude).
					Not valid in When: on S3 dedi.
CONSOLE_PROG / DURANGO_PROG / PS4_PROG / PC_PROG
LOBBY / MAP_* / GAMEMODE_*

CANONICAL FILE -- LIVE = s21-full\platform\scripts (sole product tree; no dual deploy).
Brace-less root REQUIRED for S3 dedi RSON_TYPE_OBJECT loader.
Within-role block order is ScriptRemote registration order -- do not reorder.
AUTO_PLAYER / AUTO_PLAYER_DEV / DEVELOPER are NOT in S3 dedi When vocabulary (parse-fatal).
Autoplayer loads When: "CLIENT" only, AFTER sh_items/loadouts (ItemFlavor).
*/


